ocs-studio (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Voice transformation toolkit with Qt6 GUI.
  * Pitch/formant shifting, gender conversion, hybrid mode.
  * AI-assisted re-voicing via Ollama/llama.cpp.
  * Speech-to-text via whisper.cpp.
  * Virtual microphone for PipeWire/snd-aloop.
  * PII redaction for transcripts.

 -- OCS Studio Contributors <maintainer@ocs-studio.example>  Sat, 22 Aug 2026 17:06:06 +0200

